      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"DefaultCrudMethods.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>DefaultCrudMethods</code></a> using the given <a href=\"../RepositoryMetadata.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>RepositoryMetadata</code></a>.",
