      "source": "Default implementation to discover CRUD methods based on the given <a href=\"../RepositoryMetadata.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>RepositoryMetadata</code></a>. Will detect methods\nexposed in <a href=\"../../CrudRepository.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>CrudRepository</code></a> but also hand crafted CRUD methods that are signature compatible with the ones on\n<a href=\"../../CrudRepository.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>CrudRepository</code></a>.",
      "translation": "默认实现用于根据给定的 <a href=\"../RepositoryMetadata.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>RepositoryMetadata</code></a> 发现 CRUD 方法。它将检测在 <a href=\"../../CrudRepository.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>CrudRepository</code></a> 中公开的方法，同时也支持手动编写的与 <a href=\"../../CrudRepository.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>CrudRepository</code></a> 上方法签名兼容的 CRUD 方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the find all method of the repository. Implementations should prefer more detailed methods like\n<a href=\"../../PagingAndSortingRepository.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>PagingAndSortingRepository</code></a>'s taking a <a href=\"../../../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> or <a href=\"../../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "返回存储库的查找所有方法。实现应更倾向于使用更详细的方法，例如<a href=\"../../PagingAndSortingRepository.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>PagingAndSortingRepository</code></a>中接受<a href=\"../../../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>或<a href=\"../../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>实例的方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
